# 3D Printing Track Google Apps Script Web App URL (ends with /exec).
# Must be the 3D Printing Track sheet's own script, NEVER the Programming Track (tuwaiq-init) one.
# Check it first: opening the URL in a browser must show "service":"tuwaiq-3d-track".
# Leave empty during local development: submissions are logged to the console instead.
VITE_SUBMISSION_WEBHOOK_URL=
